      <div type="clause" n="22">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Wi">Wi</ref> 22</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif man biscopes esne tihte oþþe cyninges, cænne hine an gerefan hand oþþe hine gerefa clensie, oþþe selle to swinganne.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a person should bring a charge against a bishop’s servant or the king’s, let him clear himself in the presence of the reeve: either let the reeve clear him, or give him to be flogged.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif man biscopes esne tihte oþþe cyninges, cænne hine an gerefan hand, oþþe hine gerefa clensie, oþþe selle to swinganne.</ab>
      </div>
